      `pyVmomi.vim.vm.device.VirtualDevice.backing` must be
      unset.
      
      Args:
          config: The configuration of the virtual machine hardware.
          pool: The resource pool to which the virtual machine will be attached.
          host: The target host on which the virtual machine will run. This must
              specify a host that is a member of the ComputeResource indirectly
              specified by the pool. For a stand-alone host or a cluster with DRS,
