      Modifies VirtualCenter Server's built-in `pyVmomi.vim.HistoricalInterval`, within certain limits.
      
      Supported Modifications
      
      key
       - samplingPeriod
       - length
       - name
       - level [1]
       - enabled [2]
      
      1
       - 300 [3]
       - 86400 [4]
       - Past day
       - 1
       - true
      
      2
       - 1800
       - 604800
       - Past week
       - 1
       - true
      
      3
       - 7200
       - 2592000
       - Past month
       - 1
       - true
      
      4
       - 86400
       - 31536000 [5]
       - Past year
       - 1
       - true
      
