      The privilege checks for this operation are as follows:
      - If this is a resource pool, the privilege Resource.EditPool is required on
        this and on the parent pool or vApp.
      - If this is a vApp, the privilege VApp.ResourceConfig is required on
        this and on the parent pool or vApp.
      
      Args:
          name: If set, then the new name of the resource pool.
          config: If set, then the new resource allocation for this
              resource pool.
      
      Raises:
          pyVmomi.vim.fault.InvalidName: if the name is not a valid entity name.
          pyVmomi.vim.fault.DuplicateName: if the name is changed to an already existing name.
          pyVmomi.vim.fault.InsufficientResourcesFault: if the pool specification cannot be
