class ServiceInstanceContent(pyVmomi.vmodl.DynamicData):
   """
   The `pyVmomi.vim.ServiceInstanceContent` data object defines properties for the ServiceInstance
   managed object.
   
   The ServiceInstance itself does not have directly-accessible
   properties because reading the properties of a managed object requires
   the use of a property collector, and the property collector itself
   is a property of the `pyVmomi.vim.ServiceInstance`.
   For this reason, use the method `pyVmomi.vim.ServiceInstance.retrieveContent`
   to retrieve the `pyVmomi.vim.ServiceInstanceContent` object.
   
   Attributes:
       rootFolder: Reference to the top of the inventory managed by this service.
       propertyCollector: Reference to a per-session object for retrieving properties and updates.
       viewManager: A singleton managed object for tracking custom sets of objects.
       about: Information about the service, such as the software version.
       setting: Generic configuration for a management server.
           
           This is for example by
           vCenter to store the vCenter Settings. This is not used for a
           stand-alone host, instead the vim.host.ConfigManager.advancedOption is used.
       userDirectory: A user directory managed object.
       sessionManager: Managed object for logging in and managing sessions.
       authorizationManager: Manages permissions for managed entities in the service.
       serviceManager: A singleton managed object that manages local services.
       perfManager: A singleton managed object that manages the collection and reporting
           of performance statistics.
       scheduledTaskManager: A singleton managed object that manages scheduled tasks.
       alarmManager: A singleton managed object that manages alarms.
       eventManager: A singleton managed object that manages events.
       taskManager: A singleton managed object that manages tasks.
       extensionManager: A singleton managed object that manages extensions.
       customizationSpecManager: A singleton managed object that manages saved guest customization
           specifications.
       guestCustomizationManager: A singleton managed object that manages guest customization of
           a running VM.
           
           The typical usage is for the guest customization after the
           InstantClone operation. See `pyVmomi.vim.VirtualMachine.instantClone`.
       customFieldsManager: A singleton managed object that managed custom fields.
       accountManager: A singleton managed object that manages host local user and group accounts.
       diagnosticManager: A singleton managed object that provides access to low-level log files.
       licenseManager: A singleton managed object that manages licensing
       searchIndex: A singleton managed object that allows search of the inventory
       fileManager: A singleton managed object that allows management of files present
           on datastores.
       datastoreNamespaceManager: Datastore Namespace manager.
           
           A singleton managed object that is used to manage manipulations
           related to datastores' namespaces.
       virtualDiskManager: A singleton managed object that allows management of virtual disks
           on datastores.
       virtualizationManager: A singleton managed object that manages the discovery, analysis,
           recommendation and virtualization of physical machines
       snmpSystem: A singleton managed object that allows SNMP configuration.
           
           Not set if not supported on a particular platform.
       vmProvisioningChecker: A singleton managed object that can answer questions about the
           feasibility of certain provisioning operations.
       vmCompatibilityChecker: A singleton managed object that can answer questions about compatibility
           of a virtual machine with a host.
       ovfManager: A singleton managed object that can generate OVF descriptors (export) and create
           vApps (single-VM or vApp container-based) from OVF descriptors (import).
       ipPoolManager: A singleton managed object that supports management of IpPool objects.
           
           IP pools are
           used when allocating IPv4 and IPv6 addresses to vApps.
       dvSwitchManager: A singleton managed object that provides relevant information of
           DistributedVirtualSwitch.
       hostProfileManager: A singleton managed object that manages the host profiles.
       clusterProfileManager: A singleton managed object that manages the cluster profiles.
       complianceManager: A singleton managed object that manages compliance aspects of entities.
       localizationManager: A singleton managed object that provides methods for retrieving message
           catalogs for client-side localization support.
       storageResourceManager: A singleton managed object that provides methods for storage resource
           management.
       guestOperationsManager: A singleton managed object that provides methods for guest operations.
       overheadMemoryManager: A singleton managed object that provides methods for looking up static VM
           overhead memory.
       certificateManager: host certificate manager
           A singleton managed object to manage the certificates between the
           Certificate Server and the host.
       ioFilterManager: A singleton managed object that manages IO Filters installed on the ESXi
           hosts and IO Filter configuration of virtual disks.
       vStorageObjectManager: A singleton managed object that manages all storage objects in the
           Virtual Infrastructure.
           
           If connected to a vCenter,
           this is the `pyVmomi.vim.vslm.vcenter.VStorageObjectManager`; If connected
           to an ESXi host, this is the `pyVmomi.vim.vslm.host.VStorageObjectManager`.
           
           A storage object in the Virtual Infrastructure is represented by a
           vStorageObject.
       hostSpecManager: A singleton managed object that manages the host specification data.
       cryptoManager: A singleton managed object used to manage cryptographic keys.
       healthUpdateManager: A singleton managed object that manages the health updates.
       failoverClusterConfigurator: A singleton managed object that manages the VCHA Cluster
           configuration.
       failoverClusterManager: A singleton managed object for managing a configured VCHA Cluster.
       tenantManager: A singleton managed object used to configure tenants.
       siteInfoManager: A singleton managed object used to manage site related capabilities.
       storageQueryManager: A singleton managed object used to query storage related entities.
       directPathProfileManager: A singleton managed object used to query DirectPath profiles.
           
           Since: vSphere API Release 9.0.0.0
   """
   rootFolder: Folder
   propertyCollector: pyVmomi.vmodl.query.PropertyCollector
   viewManager: _typing.Optional[pyVmomi.vim.view.ViewManager] = None
   about: AboutInfo
   setting: _typing.Optional[pyVmomi.vim.option.OptionManager] = None
   userDirectory: _typing.Optional[UserDirectory] = None
