              TaskInfo.State.success
          fault: Fault to set, valid only if task state is
              `error`. The fault must be a of a fault type that
              directly or indirectly extends `pyVmomi.vim.fault.VimFault`.
      
      Raises:
          pyVmomi.vim.fault.InvalidState: If attempting to change states after
